### Módulo 3 — Ambient Occlusion via Framebuffer Fetch
**Extensões usadas:** `FRAMEBUFFER_FETCH` ✅ `PIXEL_LOCAL_STORAGE` ✅

```cpp
// rendering/ambient_occlusion.cpp
// O shader é injetado via unified_core.cpp no glShaderSource

const char* AO_FRAG_INJECTION = R"(
#extension GL_EXT_shader_framebuffer_fetch : require

layout(location = 0) inout vec4 fragColor;

float computeAO(vec2 uv, float depth) {
    float ao = 0.0;
    vec2 offsets[4] = vec2[4](
        vec2(0.001, 0.0), vec2(-0.001, 0.0),
        vec2(0.0, 0.001), vec2(0.0, -0.001)
    );
    for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) {
        float neighborDepth = texture(u_depth, uv + offsets[i]).r;
        ao += clamp(depth - neighborDepth, 0.0, 1.0);
    }
    return 1.0 - (ao * 0.25);
}
)";
```

